{
  "id": "1PE.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "1PE",
  "reference": "1 Petelo 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1PE 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya batoolekebagosha na bakīma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning'we a bakīma abo mutoolilwe shiigelile kwidohya ū kū bagoshi bing'we, ūlū balīho bamò batagūzunije ū mhayo, ūlū yūdūlīka badutwe kūlwa nhūngwa ja bake babo, nūūlū īkabiza shilambu ū mu nzīla ya mhayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bakūyūbūbona ū wela wa nhūngwa jing'we ja logohano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlenji wing'we būtizūbiza wa kūkoyiwa mihayo ya higūlya gūlya gītī kūshiba nzwīlī na kūzwalīla zahabu, nūūlū myenda ya mpango ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wiza wing'we būbize būbisilwe mu ng'holò, mu būmunhū ūbo būtī bo kūkenaagūka, mu moyo gwa widohya na būlembeezu, ūyo gūlī gwa mpango ntaale kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno h'ūmo jalī nī nhūngwa ja bakīma ba kale a beela, abo baalī bidohya kū bagoshi babo kūlwa kūnsanya Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo walī nū Sara; walī ng'widohya ū kūlī Abrahamu, kūshisha wang'witanaga, baba! Mukūbiza bashīke bakwe ūlū ng'ūbeeja yawiza, ng'ūleka kūsugwa na booba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we bagosha ning'we ikalagi chiza nabo a bake bing'we, a kalombele king'we katizūhangījiwa; managi gīkī ū nkīma alī gītī shiseme shigokolo. Binhagi ikūjo, nguno nabo balī bingīji hamò ning'we ū mu shakwinhwa sha būpanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigongo sha nyazunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwa kūmalīja gūlī gīkī, bizagi na gwīnda pye a bose ū mu kiganikīle, mubize banhū ba kwisaatwa na kwichīla shigongo, na kwitogwa nyadūgū; hangī mubize bidohya ū mu maganiko ging'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwishokeja yabūbi kūlwa yabūbi, nūūlū shidūki kū shidūki, alīyo ng'wilombela lubango, nguno a bing'we ng'witanwa kūlwa mhayo gwenūyo, mubize na wingīji mu lubango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Īkī ūyo atogilwe būpanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūluhiwa na shilolelo sha ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nani ūyo alang'wītīle yabūbi ūlū ng'ūbiza bakomeezu mu kwīta yawiza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nūūlū mukaluhiwa ūlū īlī kūlwa nguno ya būtūngīlīja, mukūbiza na lubango; gwike yaya ū kogoha īyo bakūyogohaga ba mu sī, yaya nūūlū kwikala ng'wibakīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we bene nkūjagi Kilisito ū mu myoyo ying'we, nguno alī Seeba ng'wela. Būl'ikanza mubize mumalīīlile kūnshokeja ose ose ūyo alamubūje mhayo kūlwa kwisagīlwa kwing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike mubize na widohya hamò na logohano, hangī mubize beela ū mu myoyo ying'we; nūūlū bakigela banhū ba kūmuhaya kībi mu kūkasondagūla a kajīle king'we a kawiza ū mulī Kilisito, bayūding'wa minala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī īlī hambū hambū kūluhiwa kūlwa nguno ya kwīta yawiza ūlū būlī būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu, kūtinda kūluhiwa kūlwa nguno ya kwīta yabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nū Kilisito akacha lūkangala lūmò dūhū kūlwa shibi shing'we; ū Ntūngīlīja ūcha kūlwa nguno yabo abo batī batūngīlīja, gīkī ang'wenhe a bing'we kūlī Mulungu. Akabūlagwa ū mu mīlī alīyo ū mulī Moyo wītwa kūbiza mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mu mbika yenīyo, ūja kwīlomeela ī myoyo ya banhū abo balugalīlilwe mu būtungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benabo hū bene abo baalī batazunije mu shikū ja ng'wa Noa, aho wiyūmīlīja bo ng'wa Mulungu walī būlindanile ū ng'wikanza lya kūbeejiwa kwa ngalaba, īyo īkabapīja bo minzī banhū bagehu, banaane dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū ī haha ū kū bing'we gūlī būlolelo ū mu būbatīījiwa ūbo būkūmupījaga, ītī kūlwa kwīnja būsoso wa mīlī, alīyo kūlwa kūnūmba Mulungu mu moyo gwape; kūlwa būjūūko bo ng'wa Yesu Kilisito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo alī ng'wigūlū ī haha kū nkono gwa būlyo go ng'wa Mulungu, higūlya ya bamalaika na mabūsugi na mabūdūla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
